      "text": "@emollick Line balancing says the same thing. You add a station only when the work won't fit inside one operator's cycle time, because every handoff is another place for a part to wait, get lost or get damaged. Start with one agent doing the whole job, then split only where it can't keep",
      "url": "https://x.com/mrmwisc/status/2122801141562183832"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1898811925892403200",
