      },
      "text": "@emollick The single loop matches what I see, and it moves the hard problem somewhere useful. \nWith one agent and 4-5 thin data tools, the guardrails stop living in a pile of subagent prompts and start living in the tools: \nwhich records each one can write, under which user, and what gets",
